Source: ssy-plugin
Package: ssy-plugin
Version: @VERSION@
Maintainer: Prajwal Shetty <prajwal.shetty@datacore.com>
Architecture: amd64
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), jq, libpve-storage-perl
Recommends: python3-systemd
Description: A proxmox storage plugin for DataCore SANsymphony.
 Ships the SANsymphony PVE storage module and the terminal UI for managing
 SSY storage: /usr/bin/ssy-plugin opens the UI. The earlier prompt-and-answer
 wizard is still available as /usr/bin/ssy-plugin-old.
 .
 The terminal UI's Python dependencies (textual and friends) are bundled under
 /usr/lib/ssy-plugin/vendor, so no python3-textual package is required and the
 plugin installs on an air-gapped node.
@PREVIEW_NOTICE@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
